Are you looking for a new challenge that keeps you physically active and makes the working day fly by? Join a modern distribution centre in the Venray area, where hard work is appreciated and teamwork is key. Work alongside your colleagues to keep the logistics process running smoothly, while developing your skills and contributing to the success of the company.You will join a friendly organisation with a positive working atmosphere, a modern warehouse and plenty of opportunities to learn and grow. Everyone is treated equally, communication is straightforward, and safety is a top priority.

Functieomschrijving:
What will you do as a logistics employee?
• Scan incoming goods and place products in the correct locations;
• Pick customer orders and carefully prepare packages for shipment;
• Replenish stock at higher levels using a reach truck, provided you hold the relevant certificates;
• Check product quality and report any damage to your supervisor;
• Keep the warehouse and your workspace clean, tidy and organised;
• Work together with colleagues to ensure the logistics process runs smoothly;
• Work in a two-shift system in this active, hands-on role.

Functievereisten:
We believe that a good fit is more important than a perfect CV. Do you recognise yourself in the points below? Then we'd love to hear from you!
• You have your own transport to get to work in Venray;
• You can comfortably hold a basic conversation in English;
• You are available to work in a rotating shift system.

Arbeidsvoorwaarden:
In return for your hard work, you can expect the following benefits:
• A gross monthly salary ranging from €2,600 to €2,900.
• Plenty of opportunities for personal and professional development.
• Work as part of a friendly team in the Venray area.
Apply now and take the next step in your logistics career!

